[boot] *** TEST-HARNESS ECONOMY GRANT ACTIVE (liveSettings.testHarness.enabled=true) *** prefix 'mcp-' money=500000 ignoreTechGate=True — applies ONLY to matching char names; real players NEVER affected ***
[boot] *** TEST UNLOCK ACTIVE (liveSettings.testUnlock.enabled=true) *** allTech=True money=500000 — every side gets the required-tech union + every wallet gets money at seat; buyability ONLY (no development completed, flight/combat stats UNMODIFIED; P470 drone gate + P488 IsObsolete still apply) ***
[boot] *** ADMIN CHEATS ACTIVE (liveSettings.adminCheats.enabled=true) *** allowNames=[mcp-*, proof*] — those names may issue the 'relocate' cheat on their OWN ship only; port extension (native has no relocate; FedSrv.CPP:2814 DoCheatCode); consumed, never broadcast as chat; *** WARNING: THE SERVER LISTENS ON A NON-LOOPBACK ADDRESS WITH ADMIN CHEATS ENABLED — NEVER ENABLE ADMIN CHEATS ON A PUBLIC/SHARED SERVER (NAME-BASED TRUST IS SELF-DECLARED AND SPOOFABLE, P602). NO shared secret set (name-only trust). ***
