[boot] broadcast.shipUpdateModel = port — port per-tick teammate SingleShipUpdate posBatch stream (today's byte-for-byte behaviour)
[boot] gc = server/concurrent (server GC: multi-heap, scales with cores; recommended for 300+ players)
